      "name": "kv-load-nontemporal-cache-modifier-costs-bandwidth",
      "title": "Streaming KV loads: the non-temporal cache modifier can cost bandwidth",
      "description": "Dropping the '.cg' non-temporal modifier on once-read KV loads in paged attention: +8.2% geomean, bit-identical, on memory-bound cases only",
      "keywords": [
        "attention",
        "decode",
